		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=5057&amp;p=36740#p36740"><![CDATA[
390+ 10W model<br>Have 2 new radios, duplicated the 2nd one to mine and went in to change the callsign in APRS to my wife's. Started seeing the beacon but still showing as mine, went back into CPS and indeed under the APRS SSID selection it was showing my callsign but at the top of the tab where it said name it was showing my wife's callsign. <br>Only other spot I knew where a callsign was is under DMR, changed the callsign there (she has no id yet, never needed one but I just applied for her to get one) and blanked out the DMR ID field. CPS would not let me back out or close the window without entering a DMR ID. FInally had to use task manager to close out the program and go back in. Is there a proper way to report this to the coding team ?<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=849">k4gps</a> — Sun Apr 13, 2025 5:43 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
